      "message": "Yes, While uploading I ignored that warning but those files are not included in this code coverage. \n\nAs of now ,\n1. fusb302.c\n2. it8xxx2.c\n3. ite_pd_intc.c\n\nThese are the files which have 0% coverage.Do we need to include these files in the code coverage? or Should I flag those files as \"LCOV_EXCL\"?",
